Subject: [PATCH] basu: make Meson link checks iOS/ld64 friendly

iOS has no librt, and Apple ld64 does not understand basu's hardcoded GNU
linker flags. Leave the deeper sd-bus source port blocked separately.

diff -ruN -U0 --exclude=*.bak a/meson.build b/meson.build
--- a/meson.build	2022-12-16 02:13:02
+++ b/meson.build	2026-07-04 23:34:31
@@ -236 +236 @@
-librt = cc.find_library('rt')
+librt = cc.find_library('rt', required: false)
@@ -309,2 +309 @@
-        link_args : ['-shared',
-                     '-Wl,--version-script=' + libsystemd_sym_path],
+        link_args : [],
